validate: the pin broke: The pinned text changed since claude-fable-5 wrote it. validate names the range: exit 1.

5
00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:43.133
derive re-attributes: The agent keeps its untouched lines. The edited line is attributed to no machine. Exit 0.

